                                                <summary xml:lang="en">A Commentary on the Lessons from the Epistles of S. Paul, the Acts and Catholic Epistles, as reed at the celebrations of the Eucharist in Lent and on other occasions throughout the year, and various extracts in Arabic.</summary>
                                                <msItem xml:id="msitem-1">
                                                    <title xml:lang="en">Lessons and accompanying commentaries from the Epistles of S. Paul, the Acts and Catholic Epistles, as reed at the celebrations of the Eucharist in Lent and on other occasions throughout the year.</title>
                                                    <title xml:lang="syr">ܕܠܐܝܠ ܬܕܠ ܥܠܝ ܒܕܐܝܗ̈ ܘܢܗܐܝܗ̈ ܡܐ ܝܩܪܐ ܡܢ ܐܠܪܣܐܝܠ ܘܐܟܒܐܪ ܐܠܪܣܠ ܘܐܠܩܐܬܘܠܝܩܘܢ ܦܝ ܐܠܩܕܐܣܐܬ. ܦܝ ܐܝܐܡ ܐܠܟܡܣܝܢ. ܘܦܝ ܐܠܚܕܘܕ ܘܐܠܣܒܘܬ ܘܐܠܐܥܝܐܪ. ܘܦܝ ܐܝܐܡ ܐܠܣܢܗ ܓܡܝܥܗܐ ܡܥ ܬܦܐܣܝܪܗܐ ܒܣܠܐܡ ܐܠܪܒ. ܐܡܝܢ܀</title>
